# Everything the build does not need. Keeping the context small matters here:
# `data/local/` holds a generated Parquet dataset that runs to hundreds of
# megabytes, and sending it to the daemon on every build would dominate the
# build time while contributing nothing - the container generates its own.

.git
.github
.venv
venv

__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.eggs
build
dist

.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov

# Generated artefacts. Mounted as a volume at run time, never baked in.
data/local
mlruns
mlartifacts
*.parquet
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Secrets must never enter an image layer, where they persist even if a later
# layer deletes them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

tests
docs
notebooks
scripts
*.md
!README.md
